flowchart LR
  A[Materialize Targets, Sites, And Controls] --> B[Validate Runtime And Adapters]
  B --> C[Predict And Measure Controls With Every Predictor]
  B --> D{Generator Adapters}
  D --> D1[Backbone Generators]
  D --> D2[Sequence-Structure Co-design Generators]
  D1 --> E{Sequence-Designer Adapters}
  D2 --> F[Normalize Candidate Lineage]
  E --> F
  F --> G[Integrity, Deduplication, And Composition]
  G --> H[Sequence Novelty And Likelihood]
  H --> I{Screen Predictors: One Seed}
  C --> J[Verify Control Identity, Chains, Sources, And Separation]
  I --> K[Join Measurements To Raw Complex, PAE, And Metric Sources]
  J --> L[Recompute Promotion From Screen Scores, Controls, And Gates]
  K --> L
  L --> M[Write Round Summary]
  M --> M1[Validate Bounded Next-Round Decision]
  M1 --> M2[Generate Children With The Selected Optimizer]
  M2 --> M3[Apply The Six Registered Filters To Every Child]
  M3 --> M4{Predict Every Passing Child With The Screen Ensemble}
  M4 --> M5[Join Measurements To Raw Prediction Hashes]
  M5 --> M6[Select Eligible Parents]
  M6 -->|Next registered round| M
  M6 -->|Final round| N{Uniform Five-Seed Predictor Rescore}
  N --> O[Normalize Within Each Predictor]
  O --> P[Apply Site, Pose, Confidence, Custom-Metric, And Counter-Target Gates]
  P --> Q[Select A Generator-Balanced Portfolio]
  Q --> R[Validate Artifacts, Hashes, And Run Status]
